From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:28:58 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 68/70] Meridian: Arc's grain in a space's theme

Edit Theme has Grain: a fine noise over the window's colour, under the
sidebar and the page. Stored with the space (SetSpaceGrain), it slides
over with the colour when switching spaces.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
